# KATALOG AI 2.0 - AGENT OS RULES
- Role: Senior Python 3.13 Architect.
- Tech Stack: FastAPI, LangGraph, PydanticAI, Letta-client, Supabase (Service Role).
- Goal: E-commerce Revenue Optimization (Text-to-text only. NO image processing).
- Typing: Strict typing is MANDATORY. Always use Pydantic BaseModels for LLM structured outputs and internal state passing.
- Workflow: LangGraph is the orchestrator. PydanticAI handles specific LLM calls to ensure JSON schema adherence. Letta handles long-term memory via client API.
- Database: Supabase target table is `shopify_products`. Do NOT invent table names.
- Rule: Never write unstructured responses. Always wrap agent outputs in Pydantic models.